# 12. 30-Day MVP Plan

### Week 1 — Customer Discovery
- Interview potential customers.
- Validate the main problem.
- Identify the highest-priority pain points.

### Week 2 — MVP Design
- Define MVP scope.
- Create user flow.
- Build prototype/wireframes.

### Week 3 — MVP Development
- Build core features.
- Test with early users.
- Fix major usability issues.

### Week 4 — Validation
- Launch MVP to early users.
- Measure usage and feedback.
- Test pricing.
- Decide whether to iterate, pivot, or continue.

